{
  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-02","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"blank","difficulty":"hit","question":"设 $f(x) = \\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sqrt[n]{1 + x^n + \\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)^n} (x > 0)$，求 $f(x)$ 的显式表达式.","answer":"$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sqrt[n]{m} = 1$","ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["夹逼准则","函数复合","函数方程"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 只需算出极限即可. 由于 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sqrt[n]{c} = 1 (c > 0)$，所以容易想到极限的夹逼原理."},{"id":"s2","text":"首先证明对于任意有限个正数 $a_i$，有"},{"id":"s3","text":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sqrt[n]{a_1^n+\\cdots+a_m^n}=\\max_i a_i."},{"id":"s4","text":"记 $a=\\max_i a_i$，则 $a\\leqslant\\sqrt[n]{\\sum a_i^n}\\leqslant a\\sqrt[n]{m}$."},{"id":"s5","text":"由于 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sqrt[n]{m}=1$，利用夹逼原理便可得到上述式子."},{"id":"s6","text":"代入 $a_1=1,a_2=x,a_3=x^2/2$ 并比较分段范围."},{"id":"s7","text":"f(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&0<x\\leqslant1\\\\x,&1<x\\leqslant2\\\\x^2/2,&x>2\\end{cases}"}],"final_answer":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&0<x\\leqslant1\\\\x,&1<x\\leqslant2\\\\x^2/2,&x>2\\end{cases}$","techniques_used":["夹逼准则","函数复合","函数方程"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"夹逼准则","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"函数复合","expected":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&0<x\\leqslant1\\\\x,&1<x\\leqslant2\\\\x^2/2,&x>2\\end{cases}$"}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例2","page":9,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example"}}
